  "_comment": [
    "Seed registry. Every entry has \"verified\": false until YOU confirm the opt-out URL",
    "still resolves and still does what the note says. Brokers rename, merge, and move",
    "these endpoints constantly. Run `python tools/verify_links.py` to flag dead URLs,",
    "and `python tools/import_ca_registry.py <csv>` to bulk-load the ~500 brokers legally",
    "required to register with California (the authoritative list).",
    "",
    "action:  deletion | suppression | sale_optout | freeze | prescreen_optout",
    "method:  form | email | both | portal | phone",
    "fcra:    true = a consumer reporting agency. They generally CANNOT delete your file",
    "         (FCRA requires accuracy, not erasure). Freeze / dispute / disclosure instead."
